--
 Gaṇacakravidhi (ascribed to Ratnākaraśānti) including 'Saṃkṣiptā Pañjikā'

 Transcription based on Péter-Dániel Szántó, 2019, 'Minor Vajrayāna texts V: The Gaṇacakravidhi attributed to Ratnākaraśānti'. In: Nina Mirnig, Marion Rastelli, Vincent Eltschinger (eds.), Tantric Communities in Context, Vienna: Austrian Academy of Sciences, pp. 275-314.

 ms: NAK 5-7871, NGMPP B 104/10.
 Tibetan translation: D 1995, rgyud, mi 190v4–192r5 (The Tibetan text here is based on the ACIP etext and has not been compared with manuscripts of the sDe dge canon)

 Prepared by Ryan Conlon, March 2021. (Note: I have normalised orthographies and incorporated emendations suggested in Szántó 2019.)
---

namo vajrasattvāya

vajrasattvaṃ praṇamyādau bhāvābhāvātmakaṃ vibhuṃ |
sarvakāmapradaṃ devaṃ vakṣye 'haṃ gaṇamaṇḍalam || 1 ||


nirvikalpaparo mantrī sarvakālasamāhitaḥ |
sarvatantrānusārajño daśatattvavidāṃ varaḥ || 2 ||

gambīrodārdharmy‡arbhyā sārdravī‡bhūtamānasaiḥ |
nirābhimānaiḥ sacchiṣyaiḥ śuśrūṣaṇaviśāradaiḥ || 3 ||

devatāgaṇasaṃkīrṇe paṃcakāmaphalaprade |
vivikte ramyagehe 'smin nijapūjāṃ samārabhet || 4 ||

jyeṣṭhānukramayogena vaṃdanā pūjanā smṛtā |
athavā guṇamāhātmyād ātitheyatvagauravāt || 5 ||

snānaṃ gandhaṃ ca vastraṃ ca mālābharaṇalepanam |
arghaṃ dhūpaṃ yathāśaktyā gaṇamaṇḍalam ārabhet || 6 ||

samāhitāya karaṇī proktaiṣā karmavajriṇī |
karṇe kṛtvāṅgalim mūrdhni dātā cāṣṭāṃgato namet || 7 ||

baliṃ ratnādibhāṇḍasthaṃ dattvā lokottarān jinān |
laukikān mantradevāṃś ca pūjayet tattvatatparaḥ ||  8 ||

mantrābhiprāyayogena padmabhāṇḍe mahāmṛtam |
daśaṅkuśaṃ ca saṃjapya sarvāṃś tān paritoṣayet || 9 ||

sarvāḥ sādhāraṇāḥ pūjāḥ sarvaguhyottarottarāḥ |
mahāsukhapade sthitvā varteta gaṇanāyakaḥ || 10 ||

vinayanibhṛtanārī namravaktrāravindā 
vipulaguṇaviśālā tattvatas tattvayogyā |
hṛdi vigatavikalpā sarvanepathyayuktā 
pṛthutarakucayugmā saṃdade kāntibhāṇḍam || 11 ||

kāyendhanaṃ samujjvālya jñānasaptārciṣā svayam |
tattvahomāya vakrādau pātayeta rasādikaṃ || 12 ||

tato hṛccandramadhyasthaṃ bindudevaṃ mahāvibhum | 
athavā sveṣṭadevādiṃ cakrābharaṇabhūṣitam || 13 ||

anāmāṅguṣṭhabuddhagrais tritattvonmathitabhāsuariḥ |
svalpajihvāgrasannyastaiḥ sudhādhārāmbubhiḥ snapet || 14 ||

nābhicakrotthitair nādair ākṛṣyākṛṣya tadrasam |
ghuṭikātrayataḥ pītvā mahāyogī sukhaṃ vaset || 15 ||

vimūmāraśum anyac ca dahanagokupañcakaṃ |
tantratantrāntare proktam anyac cāpi mahāmṛtam || 16 ||

chiḍiṃgaṃ sarvato dadyād antarīkṣasthitāya tat |
vīro vīrāya devāya sarvadevīgaṇāya ca || 17 ||

tattvaṃ daśāṅkuśaṃ prāpya dātṝṇāṃ cittaśuddhaye |
‡pratipāta X sākalyaṃ‡ bāhyadevāya ḍhaukayet || 18 ||

bhūtānāṃ sarvabuddhatvasiddhaye karuṇābalaḥ |
vajraghaṇṭānvitaiḥ stotraiś cakravartinaṃ arcayet || 19 ||

śrṃgārābhinayenaivaṃ dattvā naivedyabhājanam |
pratyekaṃ sarvam ekaṃ vā śuddhāśuddhaviparyayaiḥ || 20 ||

yatheṣṭaṃ bhojanaiḥ pānair nānāpūjākadambakaiḥ |
yathāsukhaṃ yatheṣṭaṃ ca vaded dātā ca vajriṇām || 21 ||

iti vigatavikalpaḥ siṃhavan nirviśaṃko
bhavaśamapadasaṃsthas tattvasadbhāvayuktaḥ |
svahṛdayasamaprajñāḥ kaiśikādīn pragāyan
sakalajinagaṇaughān pūjayen nṛtyato 'pi || 22 ||

yasya hastāt patet pātraṃ kramaśaḥ karavartanaiḥ |
bhaven mohād avajñāir vā tiraskārī sa daṇḍabhāk || 23 ||

kasyacid avinayotpannaiḥ manovākkāyakarmabhiḥ |
yuktaṃ tasya prakalpeta daṇḍaṃ gaṇḍādiśāntaye || 24 ||

hastadvayena mudrābhir vidhivat tadvidāṃ varaḥ |
anyonyatarpaṇaṃ kṛtvā kelikṛīḍārasotsavaiḥ || 25 ||

gambhīrodārasāṃkathyaiḥ pūjayet tattvatatparaḥ |
gītavādyādibhir nṛtyaiḥ prajñopāyaratottamaiḥ || 26 ||

samādareṇa cānyonyaṃ samaśuśrūṣayā bhṛśam |
daśapāramitāyogair yajeta yajñavid vratī || 27 ||

kṣamitvā gaṃtukāmo 'pi sāñjaliḥ saṃmukhaṃ gataḥ |
kāryaṃ kṛtvāgato dhīmān praviśet prayatoḥ nataḥ || 28 ||

sadā yogātmako bhūtvā sadā tattvaparāyaṇaḥ |
sadā vinayasampannaḥ sadā cakraṃ samācaret || 29 ||

pakvānnam iva vīrāṇāṃ mudrā sādhāraṇā smṛtā | 
tasmān niḥśeṣakāmena svāṃ parāṃ caiva pūjayet || 30 ||

yāvat svecchā sadānandaṃ līlayā tattvalīlayā |
tāvat tattvanijāṃ pūjāṃ kartavyaṃ prajñayānayā || 31 ||

cakṣurādiṃ mahopāyai rūpādi lalanāgaṇaiḥ |
vijñānena mahānandaṃ bāhye nityaṃ pravartayet || 32 ||

kuliśakamalakāntiṃ candraśubhraṃ suśubhraṃ
ghṛṇivisarajinaughān niḥsvabhāvān svabhāvān ||
atitararatiramyāṃ prajñayā sājñayā ca 
vihati mukhaśuddhyā sarvasattvaṃ susattvaḥ || 33 ||

atha visarjane prāpte maṅgalāgītistotrataḥ |
stavitvā sarvadevānāṃ cakrāṇāṃ ca samakṣataḥ || 34 ||

dātṛṇ abhyukṣya sacchiṣyān saṃyojya jinasaṃvaram |
sarvabūtāni buddhatve cānusaṃśya niruttare || 35 ||

ucchiṣṭadevān santoṣya samāsṛjya mahābalim |
dharmajñānātmako bhūtvā yuñjīta matimān śubhe || 36 ||

kiṣkumātropari sūkṣmaṃ dhyātvā dharmālayaṃ jinam |
anantāmṛtavat tasmāt sravantaṃ cintayet svake || 37 ||

hṛdayāmbaramadhyesminn akhaṇḍaśaśimaṇḍalam |
tatra dharmasamālīnaṃ sūkṣmavajraṃ sadā smaret |
‡yavaphalapramāṇaṃ ca XX vajraṃ bhāvayet || 39 ||‡

karuṇādirasopetaṃ trivimokṣaṃ manomayam |
sarvākārārthasaṃyuktaṃ nirvikāramahāsukham || 40 ||

prajñopāyātmako yogī sarvakarmaṇi sarvathā |
saṃbodhicittasadrūpaṃ cintayet tattvatatparaḥ || 41 ||

prāṇamantrākṣarair japtaṃ binduṃ prakṛtibhāsvaram |
dharmādharmair vinirmuktaṃ tattvataḥ paribhāvayet || 42 ||

tatkāle sarvakāle vā mokṣodyamaparāyaṇaḥ |
kṛtvābhyāsaṃ sadākālaṃ sa labhen mokṣasampadam || 43 ||

saṃpūjyaṃ jagatāṃ manorathaparaṃ sarveṇa dānādinā
piṣṭvā sarvavikalpamohanagaraṃ nairātmyavajrādinā |
yaś cakraṃ prativartate jinaguror jñānodayaṃ mokṣadaṃ
tasyāryasya kṛpāparasya mahato nityaṃ bhṛśaṃ śreyase || 44 ||

guṇāya gambhīraguṇopayuktaye 
vikalpakalpārjitakleśahāriṇe |
savāsanāvāsavimuktamuktaye 
vibhāvabhāvāya namo 'stu yogine || 45 ||

vibhūṣaṇair bhūṣitayāṅgayaṣṭyā  
cakrāmbare candrakaleva dhāmnā |
karoti yā kṛtyakalāpakāya
namo 'stu tāyai lalanāgaṇāyai || 46 ||

salaukikaṃ lokaguruṃ sacakriṇaṃ
vibhāvya bhāvyaṃ jagatāṃ vimuktaye |
hitāśayā yo 'nukaroti maṇḍalaṃ
namo 'stu tasmai gaṇacakravartine || 47 ||
 
sarvasattvagatinirmalabhāva-
bhāvanodbhavamahāsukhapiṇḍam |
piṇḍitottamaparārtham udāraṃ  
dārayā saha name kṛtasarvam || 48 ||

|| gaṇacakravidhiḥ samāptaḥ ||

% Diplomatic edition of the fragmentary gloss:

|| namo buddhāya || || 
 
taṃtreṣv abhiṣiktānāṃ caryāyatayennānāṃ gaṇacakravidhānam aṃtareṇa siddhir na bhavatīti kṛtvā vighnotsāraṇāya mahate siddhaye prāpanārthaṃ | sveṣṭadevamahāvajraṃdharanamaskārapūrvakagaṇacakravidhānasya saṃkṣiptā paṃjikeyaṃ || || 

  
[ad 1] tatrādau tāvat || vajrasatvam iti || abhedyāyuktaparamārthasatvaṃ bhāvābhāvātmakam iti || saṃvṛtiparamārtharūpe | vibhuṃ prabhuṃ | sabodhipakṣayogāt sarvakāma iti, mahāsukhakāmaṃ taṃ pradadātīti sarvakāmapradaṃ, devam iti divyatīti devas taṃ praṇamyādau ahaṃ gaṇamaṇḍalaṃ, yogayoginī<|dva|>dvayamaṇḍalaṃ vakṣye vadiṣyāmi || 
 
[ad 2] nirvikalpaparaḥ || nirvikalpasvabhāvaḥ | maṃtram asyāstīti maṃtrī | nityakālasamāhitaḥ | niṣadyaca||karmayānaśayanāsanamaithunādiṣu tatsvarūpeṇa samāhitaḥ, sarvataṃtrānusārajñaḥ, niravaśeṣataṃtrānugataḥ | daśatatvavidhānavit | daśatatvam iti | bāhyaguhyābhiṣekī 1 nirvikalpaviśuddhī 2 bāhyaguhyamaṇḍalajñaḥ 3 vivekasamādhikovidaḥ 4 paramārthacaryābhirataḥ 5 mudrādisarvagamanāgamane sarvakarmānusārajñaḥ 6 japahomapūjāpravartakaḥ 7 sarvatṛṣṇāvinirmuktaḥ 8 yathāyathāgocaradharmadeśakaḥ 9 advayasamatāvidhijñaḥ 10 iti || evaṃvidho yogī gaṇamaṇḍalam ārabhed (= 6c) iti saṃbaṃdhaḥ || 
 
[ad 4] devatāgaṇasaṃkīrṇaḥ | tatvasadbhāvānuraktayuvatījanākule, rūpādipaṃcaviṣayānuyukte vivikte, asajjanajanarahite, ramye gehe, manojñe, asmiṃs taṃtre nije pūjyāḥ | para[3v]mārthapūjāṃ samārabhet || kuryād ity arthaḥ |

[ad 5] jyeṣṭhānukramayogena vaṃdanā pūjanā matā || abhiṣekadīkṣājyeṣṭhānukrameṇa vaṃdanāpūjanādikaṃ kartavyaṃ | atha vā guṇamāhātmyaṃ guṇaprakarṣāc ca, atitheyatvagauravāt, deśāṃtaragato ’tithitva

[ad 6] snānaṃ gaṃdhaṃ ca mālyaṃ ca vastrābharaṇalepanaṃ || artha dhūpaṃ yathāśaktyā gaṇamaṇḍalam ārabhet || yathāśaktyā kubjaṃvo(?)payuktena gaṇacakraṃ kartavyaṃ || śeṣaṃ sugamaṃ ||  

[ad 7] samāhitāya karaṇī prokteṣā karmavajriṇī || karṇe kṛtāṃjaliṃ mūrddhnā kāyavākcittavikṣepārthaṃ yogakaraṇīṃ karmavajriṇyā gaṇānāṃ pratyekamūrddhni aṃjaliṃ kṛtvā karṇe kartavyaṃ || paścād dātā cāṣṭārgena cakraṃ praṇāmyate || 
 
[ad 8] baliṃ ratnādibhāṇḍasthaṃ khādyādikaṃ ratnābhāṇḍe sthāpayitvā lokottarān jinān tathāgatādīn ādau datvā paścāl laukikān hariharahiraṇyagarbhādīn maṃtradevāṃś ca kṣetrādipratibaṃdhān pūjayet tatvatatparaḥ || arcayet tatvavidhānajñaḥ ||  
 
[ad 9] tatvābhiprāyayogena samāyātitaṃtrakrameṇa padmabhāṇḍe mahāmṛtaṃ || kapālādibhāṇḍe paṃcāmṛtādikam aṃkuśaś cādau samayakuśaṃ ca saṃjapya maṃtrapūtaṃ kṛtvā sarvān tān gaṇān paritoṣayet || pradātavyaṃ || 
 
[ad 10] sarvāḥ sādhāraṇāḥ pūjyā sakalajagatsukhāvāptakāraṇāḥ sarvaguhyogurottarā niravaśeṣaparamārtharahasyānāṃ rahasyatarā || mahāsukhapade sthitvā prajñopāyasamarase sthitvā vartanta gaṇanāyakaḥ || taccakravartī   

[ad 11] vineyanibhṛtanārī savinayā yoṣit namravaktrāraviṃdā īṣannamramukhapadmā vipulaguṇaviśālā, ativistaraguṇayuktā tatvā tatvayogyā 
